  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support India&apos;s first HIV/AIDS hospital</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">There are over two million people living with HIV and AIDS (PLHA) in India. Since 2013, we have provided free or subsidised healthcare and counselling to over 25,000 PLHA and their families that others have refused to touch. Our 30-bed hospital Includes surgical, intensive care, pre- and post-natal care, respirators, X-ray, laboratory testing and dental facilities and will provide life-saving treatment to thousands more.</narrative>
  </description>
